1
00:00:01,438 --> 00:00:04,168
好了 同志們 你們可以考慮涂一下防曬霜
Okay, folks, you might want to put on some sunscreen.

2
00:00:04,168 --> 00:00:06,408
這里海拔高 樹木都開始變得稀疏了
Up this high, the trees start to thin out.

3
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:08,200
這兒可能挺適合拍照的
Oh, this might be a good place for a picture.

4
00:00:08,248 --> 00:00:09,378
容我去一下那塊石頭后面
Oh, let me go behind that rock.

5
00:00:09,378 --> 00:00:10,879
我要換上我的下一套造型
I'll change into my next look.

6
00:00:10,958 --> 00:00:11,808
又一套
Another one?

7
00:00:11,808 --> 00:00:14,388
沒辦法 他照片分享網的粉絲要求的
He has to. His Instagram follower demands it.

8
00:00:14,388 --> 00:00:15,359
老鷹
Eagle!

9
00:00:15,368 --> 00:00:16,478
不對 假警報
Oh, wait, false alarm.

10
00:00:16,478 --> 00:00:17,968
只是樹上的一個塑料袋
It's just a plastic bag in a tree.

11
00:00:17,968 --> 00:00:18,818
老鷹啊
Eagle!

12
00:00:18,818 --> 00:00:20,029
不是 抱歉
Nope. Sorry.

13
00:00:20,288 --> 00:00:21,259
袋子掉下來了
Bag fell.

14
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:23,520
每年冬天
Every winter,

15
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:26,060
我都要和兄弟們一起來個觀鳥之旅...
I take a bird-watching trip with my buddies --

16
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:27,900
專門去看白頭鷹[美國國鳥]
specifically to see a bald eagle.

17
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:29,760
目前為止 還沒見到過
So far, no luck.

18
00:00:29,817 --> 00:00:33,317
今年兄弟們來不了 不是背部抽筋 就是屁股開花
This year, my buddies bailed -- back spasm, cracked hip.

19
00:00:33,317 --> 00:00:36,037
當初裝淋浴防滑椅時 誰笑我白癡來著
And I'm the idiot for installing a shower chair.

20
00:00:36,067 --> 00:00:37,657
我本打算一個人去
I was all set to go solo,

21
00:00:37,657 --> 00:00:40,577
結果這三個粘人精不請自來
when those three tagalongs invited themselves.

22
00:00:40,577 --> 00:00:42,087
他們像一群栗胸森鶯一樣
They invaded my territory

23
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:44,180
侵入了我的領土
like a bunch of bay-breasted warblers.

24
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:46,980
我難道感覺不到自己像一只栗胸森鶯
Darned if I didn't feel like a bay-breasted warbler

25
00:00:47,027 --> 00:00:50,317
闖入杰的旅途嗎 可歌洛莉亞非讓我們來
horning in on Jay's trip, but Gloria made us go.

26
00:00:50,317 --> 00:00:51,697
她很擔心我爸
She was worried about my dad

27
00:00:51,697 --> 00:00:53,517
這么大年紀了還一個人在林子里轉悠
being out in the woods alone at his age,

28
00:00:53,517 --> 00:00:56,167
所以她輕輕地推了我們一把 讓我們加入
so she -- she gently nudged us to join him.

29
00:00:56,167 --> 00:00:58,447
歌洛莉亞 如果我爸不想讓我們...
Gloria, if my dad doesn't want us t--

30
00:00:59,297 --> 00:01:01,447
爸爸 你這周末要干什么去呀
Hey, Dad, uh, whatcha doin' this weekend?

31
00:01:01,497 --> 00:01:03,557
-小小的自然之旅 -聽起來很有趣啊
- Ah, little nature trip. - Oh! Sounds like fun.

32
00:01:03,557 --> 00:01:04,677
-帶上我們吧 -沒錯
- Count us in! - Yes.

33
00:01:04,677 --> 00:01:06,047
其實我本來打算獨處一...
Actually, I was looking for a little alone time --

34
00:01:06,047 --> 00:01:09,677
我是唯一一個腦子里想到白頭鷹的人嗎
Hey! Am I the only one with bald eagles on the brain?

35
00:01:11,046 --> 00:01:12,526
你知道嗎 我想大約10分鐘后
You know what? I think in about 10 minutes,

36
00:01:12,526 --> 00:01:13,526
光線會很完美
the light's gonna be perfect

37
00:01:13,526 --> 00:01:15,256
適合拍我的"下午冒險"造型
for my "Afternoon Adventurer" look.

38
00:01:15,256 --> 00:01:17,526
好了 在我們走入森林更深處之前
Okay, uh, before we head deeper into the woods,

39
00:01:17,526 --> 00:01:18,856
我要警告你們 這片區域
I should warn you folks that there's been

40
00:01:18,856 --> 00:01:21,086
有著多次目擊熊出沒的記錄
several bear sightings in the area.

41
00:01:21,086 --> 00:01:23,316
-如果你們恰好帶了食物的話 -明白
- So if you happen to have any food with you -- - Got it!

42
00:01:26,206 --> 00:01:27,186
我正想說
I was going to say

43
00:01:27,186 --> 00:01:29,746
你們可以存在防熊箱里... 就在這兒
you can store it in this bear box... here.

44
00:01:29,746 --> 00:01:31,166
好的
Oh. Um, okay.

45
00:01:31,166 --> 00:01:32,386
那么 你們自己先聊會兒天
Well, then, talk amongst yourselves.

46
00:01:32,386 --> 00:01:33,776
我可能要花一會兒時間
It could take me a while

47
00:01:33,776 --> 00:01:36,046
才能找回被我陽剛之力丟遠的沉重背包...
to find where my manly heave sent that heavy --

48
00:01:36,046 --> 00:01:38,086
在這兒呢 肯定是有人把它扔回來了
Ah! Here it is. Someone must've heaved it back.

49
00:01:38,220 --> 00:01:38,850
謝謝
Thank you!

50
00:01:53,955 --> 00:01:55,265
有人嗎
Hello!

51
00:01:55,265 --> 00:01:57,345
歌洛莉亞 謝謝你能來
Oh, hey, Gloria. Thanks for coming.

52
00:01:57,345 --> 00:01:58,985
這個女生之夜肯定會很有趣的
It's gonna be such a fun girls' night --

53
00:01:59,070 --> 00:02:01,000
喝著酒 規劃著育兒室
drinking wine, planning the nursery.

54
00:02:01,290 --> 00:02:03,090
好了 我本來是要給你驚喜的
Okay, I was going to surprise you,

55
00:02:03,090 --> 00:02:04,510
但我等不及了
but I can't wait anymore.

56
00:02:05,695 --> 00:02:09,585
這是個由歷史上偉大女性組成的手工床鈴
It's a handmade mobile of great women in history!

57
00:02:09,585 --> 00:02:11,155
埃莉諾·羅斯福[美總統羅斯福的夫人]
Eleanor Roosevelt,

58
00:02:11,155 --> 00:02:13,295
羅莎·帕克斯[拒絕給白人讓座的黑人女性]
Rosa Parks!

59
00:02:13,295 --> 00:02:14,455
我只希望它能契合
I just hope it goes with the theme

60
00:02:14,610 --> 00:02:16,030
迪蘭希望的房間主題
that Dylan wants for the room.

61
00:02:16,030 --> 00:02:17,610
這些女性有沒有在消防車
Are any of these women important in the fields

62
00:02:17,610 --> 00:02:20,170
或是獨角獸方面有杰出成就的
of fire trucks or unicorns?

63
00:02:20,510 --> 00:02:22,630
這多完美啊
How perfect is this?

64
00:02:22,630 --> 00:02:24,510
他們送來了嬰兒床
They delivered the crib,

65
00:02:24,510 --> 00:02:27,450
我知道在場剛好有一隊手工能手們
and I know just the crew of handy honeys

66
00:02:27,450 --> 00:02:28,450
會幫我把它組裝起來的
to help me put it together.

67
00:02:28,735 --> 00:02:31,085
現在不行 媽媽 我今天過得很糟糕
Uh, not now, Mom. I've had the worst day.

68
00:02:31,085 --> 00:02:31,895
我也是
Me, too.

69
00:02:31,895 --> 00:02:32,665
快點 擠點淚出來
Quick, start crying.

70
00:02:32,665 --> 00:02:35,065
我們得盡快澆滅她的熱情 趕在...
We need to derail her enthusiasm before she s--

71
00:02:36,165 --> 00:02:36,755
太晚了
Unh! Too late.

72
00:02:36,810 --> 00:02:37,690
她已經開始跳了
She's dancing.

73
00:02:37,944 --> 00:02:40,474
太棒了 姐妹們
Way to rock it, girlfriend!

74
00:02:41,550 --> 00:02:43,110
我無法再否認下去了
I cannot deny it anymore.

75
00:02:43,270 --> 00:02:45,630
我變得越來越像白種女人了
I am turning into a white woman.

76
00:02:48,130 --> 00:02:50,430
有什么問題嗎 姐妹們
Is there a problem, girlfriends?

77
00:02:50,504 --> 00:02:52,434
單車課程取消了
Spin class was canceled!

78
00:02:52,530 --> 00:02:53,150
不是吧
No!

79
00:02:53,454 --> 00:02:55,134
那我們今天要干什么呢
What are we gonna do with our day?

80
00:02:55,134 --> 00:02:56,085
"困惑時...
"When In Doubt...

81
00:02:56,950 --> 00:02:57,470
就吃早午餐"
Brunch."

82
00:02:57,614 --> 00:02:59,214
最近的一處賣羽衣甘藍
Where's the nearest place that serves kale

83
00:02:59,330 --> 00:03:01,290
并且店名里有雙關語的地方在哪里
and also has a pun in its name?

84
00:03:01,524 --> 00:03:03,764
這條街的盡頭有一家地下甘藍路餐廳
There's an Underground Kale-Road down the street!

85
00:03:03,764 --> 00:03:04,935
-我們走 -感謝上帝
- Let's go! - Thank God.

86
00:03:05,650 --> 00:03:07,770
我最近變得軟弱了
I've gotten soft lately.

87
00:03:07,894 --> 00:03:10,074
我想我已經失去了哥倫比亞魂
I think I've lost my Colombian edge.

88
00:03:10,074 --> 00:03:12,554
我想如果我們做成一件事 就能振奮起來
I think we'll all feel better if we accomplish something.

89
00:03:12,554 --> 00:03:14,254
是啊 不像杰
Yes. Unlike Jay.

90
00:03:14,254 --> 00:03:17,524
他去這些打獵旅行已經有二十年了
He's been going on these hunting trips for 20 years,

91
00:03:17,610 --> 00:03:21,130
而他一次也沒有獵回白頭鷹過
and not once has he brought home a bald eagle!

92
00:03:25,390 --> 00:03:26,550
天哪
Oh, God.

93
00:03:26,550 --> 00:03:28,370
亨德里克斯[著名電吉他演奏者]不識譜
Hendrix couldn't read music,

94
00:03:28,370 --> 00:03:29,650
沙克[籃球明星]罰球很爛
Shaq couldn't make free throws,

95
00:03:29,650 --> 00:03:32,430
而我想象空間與大小的能力很差
and I have a little trouble visualizing space and scale.

96
00:03:32,430 --> 00:03:35,210
這個衣柜設計可以在緊湊的住宅空間中
So, I think this closet design gives us everything we need

97
00:03:35,210 --> 00:03:36,530
提供我們所需的全部功能
in a tight, residential space.

98
00:03:36,530 --> 00:03:38,030
是啊 很巧妙
Yeah. Very clever.

99
00:03:38,030 --> 00:03:39,050
演練一下
Take a walk-through.

100
00:03:39,223 --> 00:03:40,653
看看動線是不是合理
Does the flow make sense?

101
00:03:41,210 --> 00:03:42,330
好吧
Well, um...

102
00:03:42,430 --> 00:03:44,110
我會在洗完澡后
I would get out of the shower

103
00:03:44,110 --> 00:03:47,110
把衣服扔進這里的衣籃
and throw my clothes in the hamper here,

104
00:03:47,110 --> 00:03:49,130
拿一件衣服 然后在這里著裝完畢
pick out an outfit, and then get dressed right here.

105
00:03:49,130 --> 00:03:51,190
你剛剛把你的衣服扔進了壁爐
You just threw your clothes in the fireplace

106
00:03:51,190 --> 00:03:53,110
然后在落地窗前穿好衣服
and got dressed in front of the picture window.

107
00:03:53,313 --> 00:03:56,143
你有你早晨起床的方式 米婭
Well, you have your morning routine, Mia.

108
00:03:56,150 --> 00:03:57,010
我也有我的嘛
I have mine.

109
00:03:59,223 --> 00:04:01,033
好了 讓我們看一遍
All right, let's get this over with.

110
00:04:01,190 --> 00:04:02,650
媽媽 我們從哪兒開始呢
Mom, where do we start?

111
00:04:03,510 --> 00:04:06,930
也許老娘需要一點熟女汁[酒]
Maybe Mommy just needs some cougar juice!

112
00:04:08,090 --> 00:04:10,030
我這是怎么了
What's wrong with me?

113
00:04:11,410 --> 00:04:12,650
大家注意腳下
Watch your step, folks.

114
00:04:12,650 --> 00:04:14,150
徒步走到這一段路的時候
Some of the terrain gets a little tricky

115
00:04:14,150 --> 00:04:15,250
有的地形就不太好走了
on this part of the hike.

116
00:04:15,262 --> 00:04:16,582
真好 我還以為我換
Oh. Good. I thought I'd changed

117
00:04:16,770 --> 00:04:18,670
"路遙啟程"裝換早了
into my "Remote Trailhead" look too soon.

118
00:04:19,322 --> 00:04:21,312
你還行嗎 爸 要不要停下來休息一會
You okay, Dad? Want to stop and take a break?

119
00:04:21,312 --> 00:04:23,752
不 不用 我就是想停下來看看有沒有鷹
No, no. I just want to stop and maybe see an eagle. Ah.

120
00:04:25,250 --> 00:04:26,050
大家看看吧
Everybody look.

121
00:04:28,162 --> 00:04:30,152
你徒步了二十年都沒見過一只鷹 是嗎
You've been doing this for 20 years and never seen one, huh?

122
00:04:30,152 --> 00:04:32,602
是的 噓
Correct. Shh.

123
00:04:34,672 --> 00:04:37,402
是啊 大自然有時候真的很...
Yeah. Mother Nature can be a real --

124
00:04:37,402 --> 00:04:38,903
菲爾 別說話了
Phil, stop talking!

125
00:04:39,052 --> 00:04:40,502
你把鷹都嚇跑了
You're scaring the eagles!

126
00:04:40,502 --> 00:04:41,362
對不起
I'm sorry.

127
00:04:41,362 --> 00:04:42,583
我的錯 我的錯
My bad. My bad.

128
00:04:42,842 --> 00:04:43,772
我真誠地對不起
Also sorry in my head.

129
00:04:43,772 --> 00:04:45,013
真是的
Oh, my God!

130
00:04:45,742 --> 00:04:48,472
趁著大家在聊天 我們應該往回走了
Since we're talking again, uh, we should start heading back.

131
00:04:48,690 --> 00:04:49,630
天很快就會黑了
It'll be dark soon.

132
00:04:49,691 --> 00:04:51,791
或者 你們愿意的話 這條小路前面有個小木屋
Or, if you'd like, there's a cabin just up this trail.

133
00:04:51,791 --> 00:04:52,941
有點陳舊 不過...
It's pretty run-down, but, uh,

134
00:04:52,941 --> 00:04:54,041
你們可以在那里過夜
you're welcome to spend the night.

135
00:04:54,041 --> 00:04:54,990
我要去
I'll do it.

136
00:04:55,011 --> 00:04:57,481
這不太像個好主意啊
Uh... Are -- Are we sure that's a good idea?

137
00:04:57,671 --> 00:04:59,561
不是說有熊嗎
Um...wasn't there -- wasn't there mention of bears?

138
00:04:59,810 --> 00:05:01,180
不用 你回家吧 我自己留在這里
No, you go home. I'll stay by myself.

139
00:05:02,801 --> 00:05:04,101
我們不能讓他一個人過夜
We -- We can't let him stay by himself.

140
00:05:04,101 --> 00:05:05,541
我們跟歌洛莉亞保證過他的安全
We told Gloria we'd keep him safe.

141
00:05:05,750 --> 00:05:07,130
是啊 要是他要留下來 我們也要留下來
Yeah, if he's staying, we're staying.

142
00:05:07,361 --> 00:05:09,721
好吧 好吧 最壞能壞到哪去呢
Yeah. Yeah. What -- What's the worst that could happen?

143
00:05:09,721 --> 00:05:11,811
想想電影里城里人在廢棄的小木屋過夜
I mean, in the movies, when city folk stay overnight

144
00:05:11,930 --> 00:05:14,490
通常都是平平安安 絕對沒有殺人魔
in abandoned cabins, things usually pan out okay.

145
00:05:14,570 --> 00:05:16,790
不管了 我要到前面去看看
Anyway, I'm gonna run ahead, see if they have any postcards

146
00:05:16,790 --> 00:05:18,530
這個安保糟糕的精神病院有沒有明信片
up at this poorly guarded mental institution.

147
00:05:21,681 --> 00:05:22,921
靠 我要餓死了
Damn it, I'm starving.

148
00:05:22,921 --> 00:05:24,871
這里除了一瓶舊威士忌什么都沒有
Nothing in here but an old bottle of whiskey.

149
00:05:24,871 --> 00:05:26,881
不要一直想著你有多餓或者想著
Well, just try not to think about how hungry you are

150
00:05:27,010 --> 00:05:28,950
米奇爾把吃的都放在防熊箱里了
or that Mitchell left the food in the bear box.

151
00:05:28,950 --> 00:05:30,090
我們都把食物放在...
We all left the food in the --

152
00:05:30,090 --> 00:05:31,390
你又換衣服了嗎
Did you change again?

153
00:05:32,190 --> 00:05:33,530
是啊 我又混搭了幾件
Yeah, I just threw a few things together

154
00:05:33,530 --> 00:05:36,010
來了一套"鄉間小屋"裝
to create a "Rustic Cabin" look.

155
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:37,970
至少不用擔心熊的問題
Well, at least the bears won't be a concern.

156
00:05:37,970 --> 00:05:39,120
信我這個房產經紀人的話
Take it from a realtor.

157
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:41,720
這把史密斯威利鎖可是上好品質
This Smith & Wiley lock is the gold standard.

158
00:05:49,890 --> 00:05:52,530
好了 我覺得我們現在可以拼起
All right, I think we are now ready to put together

159
00:05:52,530 --> 00:05:55,850
我們漂亮的L形嬰兒床了
our beautiful, L-shaped crib.

160
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:58,570
這不對啊 一邊比另一邊大太多了
I-I-- This can't be right. One's way bigger.

161
00:05:58,570 --> 00:06:01,160
而且 我的寶寶要像在中繼之家一樣
And what, my babies are supposed to come and go as they please,

162
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:02,450
想來就來想走就走嗎
like they're in a halfway house?

163
00:06:02,450 --> 00:06:05,810
好吧 稍微有點看錯了圖紙
Um, so, a minor misreading of the diagram.

164
00:06:05,810 --> 00:06:07,010
我覺得我們把長邊和短邊
I think we're just gonna need to swap

165
00:06:07,110 --> 00:06:08,850
換一下位置
a short side for a long side.

166
00:06:08,850 --> 00:06:10,790
同時再把支架折彎就可以了
And in the meantime, we bent that bracket.

167
00:06:10,790 --> 00:06:12,450
艾麗克斯 你能去趟五金店嗎
Alex, would you mind running down to the hardware store?

168
00:06:12,590 --> 00:06:13,290
不可能
No way.

169
00:06:13,430 --> 00:06:15,150
我不相信自己的開車技術了
I don't trust myself to drive anymore.

170
00:06:15,770 --> 00:06:17,530
我報名當了一個學校訪問學者的
I signed up to be the student liaison

171
00:06:17,530 --> 00:06:19,290
學生聯絡員
for a visiting scholar on campus --

172
00:06:19,290 --> 00:06:20,610
肯尼斯·彭羅斯先生
Sir Kenneth Penrose.

173
00:06:20,610 --> 00:06:22,990
是的 大名鼎鼎的肯尼斯·彭羅斯先生
Yes, that Sir Kenneth Penrose.

174
00:06:22,990 --> 00:06:25,170
微生物學界的搖滾明星啊
Rock star of the microbiology world.

175
00:06:25,449 --> 00:06:26,859
我知道你可能都要聽膩了
I know you must hear this a lot,

176
00:06:26,870 --> 00:06:28,610
但你是我開始打臺球的原因
but you're the reason I took up snooker.

177
00:06:28,870 --> 00:06:29,610
你還有打嗎
Do you still play?

178
00:06:29,610 --> 00:06:31,330
最近我不得不放下臺球
I've had to lay down my cue lately.

179
00:06:31,690 --> 00:06:33,930
這幾個月我一直在研究埃博拉疫苗
I've been working for months on an Ebola vaccine.

180
00:06:33,930 --> 00:06:35,730
就在剛剛 我有了重大突破
Just moments ago, I had a breakthrough.

181
00:06:35,870 --> 00:06:37,730
我簡直等不及去實驗室記下
I can't wait to get to the lab and jot --

182
00:06:40,909 --> 00:06:41,969
那是我的化學老師
Whoa! That was my chemistry advisor.

183
00:06:41,969 --> 00:06:44,139
我可不希望自己出名是因為
I would not want to be known as the girl who --

184
00:06:45,150 --> 00:06:46,030
肯尼斯先生
Sir Kenneth?

185
00:06:46,179 --> 00:06:48,849
我在哪
W-Where am I?

186
00:06:49,510 --> 00:06:50,710
你不知道有多羞愧
You don't know the shame.

187
00:06:50,710 --> 00:06:52,130
現在除了像社會學教授那樣的笨蛋
Now they won't let me drive around

188
00:06:52,130 --> 00:06:54,690
他們誰都不讓我載了
anyone smarter than a sociology professor.

189
00:06:54,690 --> 00:06:57,350
你知道今天還有誰摔地上了嗎 我
You know what else hit the ground today? Me.

190
00:06:57,439 --> 00:07:00,099
就在我彎腰撿地板上的甜甜圈的時候
While I was bending over to pick up a doughnut off the floor!

191
00:07:00,399 --> 00:07:02,348
上面沾了好多灰 不過我不在乎
It was covered in dust balls, but I didn't care,

192
00:07:02,348 --> 00:07:03,828
因為我是個惡心的大豬怪
'cause I'm a disgusting pig monster.

193
00:07:03,828 --> 00:07:05,148
寶貝 別這么說
Oh, honey, please.

194
00:07:05,148 --> 00:07:06,069
你還是像
You're as --

195
00:07:06,098 --> 00:07:07,628
以前一樣漂亮
as beautiful as ever.

196
00:07:07,628 --> 00:07:09,109
跟"臉部解鎖"說去吧
Tell that to MugScan.

197
00:07:09,548 --> 00:07:12,718
那是我上班的地方用的一個人臉識別軟件
MugScan is a face-recognition program we use at work.

198
00:07:12,930 --> 00:07:14,430
那軟件對我很不友好
It was really mean to me.

199
00:07:16,590 --> 00:07:18,150
早上好 韋恩
Good morning, Wayne.

200
00:07:18,150 --> 00:07:18,730
韋恩
Wayne?

201
00:07:18,730 --> 00:07:20,570
我才不是韋恩 你個大混蛋
I'm not Wayne, you jerk!

202
00:07:31,848 --> 00:07:33,049
你沒事吧 海莉
You all right, Haley?

203
00:07:33,610 --> 00:07:35,070
我沒事 韋恩
I'm fine, Wayne.

204
00:07:35,808 --> 00:07:37,938
我摔倒的時候一只鞋掉了
One of my shoes flew off in the fall,

205
00:07:37,938 --> 00:07:40,508
而我都穿不回去 因為我的腳太腫了
and I couldn't put it back on because my feet were so swollen.

206
00:07:40,508 --> 00:07:43,168
你知道誰做鞋做得好嗎 新百倫
You know who makes a great shoe? New Balance.

207
00:07:43,168 --> 00:07:45,977
我快走去看尼爾·戴蒙德[歌手]的時候就穿這鞋
I wear them when I power-walk to Neil Diamond.

208
00:07:46,677 --> 00:07:49,027
媽 這個隔板是不是有點高
Hey, Mom, is this divider a little too high?

209
00:07:49,350 --> 00:07:50,850
沒有啊 就應該是那樣的
No. No, it's supposed to be that way.

210
00:07:50,850 --> 00:07:53,370
那樣的話 要是一個寶寶想去看他的兄弟
That way, if one twin wants to visit the other,

211
00:07:53,387 --> 00:07:56,617
他就可以噠噠噠走過來"你好呀"
he can just go, "Ah, doot, doot, doot. Hi!"

212
00:08:00,490 --> 00:08:02,090
我有點小想法
Couple thoughts.

213
00:08:02,857 --> 00:08:04,697
對七 對A
Pair of 7s. Ace high.

214
00:08:04,697 --> 00:08:07,867
大家好 讓你們見見多恩·萊蒙和魯保羅
Everyone, I'd like you to meet Don Lemon and RuPaul,

215
00:08:07,867 --> 00:08:08,951
一對黑皇后[黑人騷基]
a pair of black queens.

216
00:08:09,150 --> 00:08:12,010
米奇爾 這都是你第三次晃蕩到那兒了
Mitchell, that's the third time you've wandered over there.

217
00:08:12,010 --> 00:08:12,590
你在那干什么呢
What are you doing?

218
00:08:13,157 --> 00:08:15,037
-沒什么 -他嘴里有東西
- Nothing. - He's got something in his mouth.

219
00:08:15,037 --> 00:08:16,577
-抓住他 過來 -沒 我沒吃
- Get him! come here! - No. No, I don't.

220
00:08:16,577 --> 00:08:18,397
-別 別 -別反抗
- No, no, no! - Don't -- Don't fight. Don't --

221
00:08:18,550 --> 00:08:19,910
他有牛肉干
He has beef jerky!

222
00:08:19,910 --> 00:08:21,210
這是最后一塊了 我發誓
That's the last of it. I swear.

223
00:08:21,237 --> 00:08:23,007
-他撒謊 檢查口袋 -沒有 我
- He's lying. Check his pockets. - No, I --

224
00:08:23,127 --> 00:08:24,247
住手 住手
Stop it, stop it, stop it!

225
00:08:24,247 --> 00:08:25,647
是家庭裝的
It's a family pack!

226
00:08:25,647 --> 00:08:27,787
我希望牛肉干[混蛋]的滋味和這諷刺一樣足
I hope the jerky was as delicious as the irony.

227
00:08:27,787 --> 00:08:29,766
-交出來 -不 停手 停手
- Give it! - No, stop it! Stop it --

228
00:08:29,766 --> 00:08:31,017
不
No!

229
00:08:31,610 --> 00:08:34,250
太好了 我們給滿森林的熊
Great. We're sending beef smoke signals

230
00:08:34,250 --> 00:08:35,610
發了牛肉味信號
to a forest full of bears.

231
00:08:35,636 --> 00:08:37,436
對不起 我本該分享的
I'm sorry! I should've shared!

232
00:08:37,436 --> 00:08:39,626
與此同時 有滿滿一背包的遠足零食
Meanwhile, there is a sack full of hiking snacks

233
00:08:39,626 --> 00:08:40,806
就在路那頭
just up the road!

234
00:08:40,806 --> 00:08:41,646
干酪 熏火腿
Brie, prosciutto,

235
00:08:41,690 --> 00:08:44,330
更別提還有歌洛莉亞在品趣志上推薦的
not to mention a wonderful maple-walnut butter

236
00:08:44,330 --> 00:08:46,310
美味的楓糖核桃味黃油
that Gloria recommended on her Pinterest board.

237
00:08:46,310 --> 00:08:47,550
我受夠了 我要出去
That's it. I'm going out there.

238
00:08:47,550 --> 00:08:48,370
杰 等等
Jay, wait!

239
00:08:48,370 --> 00:08:50,460
假如你看到了熊 記住
If you see a bear, remember --

240
00:08:50,946 --> 00:08:52,626
用手機上的手電筒晃他
blind it with the flash on your phone,

241
00:08:52,626 --> 00:08:54,716
然后用順從的姿勢躺到地上
then lie on your back in a submissive pose.

242
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:57,000
我不會那么做的 假如我和熊迎頭碰上
I'm not doing that. If I come face-to-face with a bear,

243
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:57,700
它最好逃命去
he better run!

244
00:09:03,116 --> 00:09:03,787
外面好黑
It's darker out there --

245
00:09:07,916 --> 00:09:09,196
你確定這主意好嗎
Are you sure it was the best idea

246
00:09:09,196 --> 00:09:11,656
不該先搬到樓上再組裝嗎
to attach these before moving them upstairs?

247
00:09:11,656 --> 00:09:15,085
我肉眼量過 應該能輕松通過
Yeah, I eyeballed the space. It really should fit easily.

248
00:09:15,855 --> 00:09:18,755
只不過艾麗克斯把我們"開進死胡同"了
Except Alex apparently has steered us into a jam.

249
00:09:19,395 --> 00:09:21,595
肯定是送披薩的 我來了 卡爾
Oh, that must be the pizza guy. Coming, Carl!

250
00:09:21,595 --> 00:09:23,415
你知道送披薩的叫什么嗎
You know the pizza guy's name?

251
00:09:23,415 --> 00:09:24,426
才不知道
No!

252
00:09:27,705 --> 00:09:28,676
海莉
Hey, Haley.

253
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:30,840
真驚訝 你居然在午夜前點披薩
Surprised to get an order from you before midnight.

254
00:09:30,840 --> 00:09:31,840
對了 上次那個
By the way, how'd you like

255
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:33,420
特別定制的蝦薯披薩好吃嗎
that custom shrimp and potato pizza?

256
00:09:33,880 --> 00:09:35,870
我根本不知道你在胡說什么
I don't even know what you're talking about.

257
00:09:37,100 --> 00:09:37,940
愛死了 也愛死你了
Loved it. Love you.

258
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:38,860
我去拿錢包
Gonna go get my wallet!

259
00:09:43,660 --> 00:09:44,100
媽
Mom?

260
00:09:44,100 --> 00:09:44,540
好吧
Okay.

261
00:09:44,685 --> 00:09:47,015
艾麗克斯 快去樓下拿個螺絲刀
Alex, run downstairs and get a screwdriver.

262
00:09:47,015 --> 00:09:49,575
等我們把柵欄拆了就能輕松通過了
This whole thing will fit easily once we take the cribs apart.

263
00:09:49,575 --> 00:09:50,415
我們根本不知道
We don't even know

264
00:09:50,420 --> 00:09:52,660
這東西能不能通過臥室門
if this thing is gonna fit through the bedroom door.

265
00:09:52,820 --> 00:09:53,960
當然能通過
Of course it will.

266
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:57,160
但要是能讓你高興 我再量一次
But if it makes you happy, I will measure again.

267
00:10:02,834 --> 00:10:03,845
瞧
See?

268
00:10:06,884 --> 00:10:08,704
你總把我錄的節目覆蓋...
You always record over my programs --

269
00:10:15,560 --> 00:10:17,300
好吧 這樣如何
Okay, no, how about this?

270
00:10:17,324 --> 00:10:20,434
我們圍在一起組成一個大塊頭
We all band together to form one big man

271
00:10:20,434 --> 00:10:21,354
去拿吃的
to go get the food.

272
00:10:21,354 --> 00:10:22,114
不 這怎么能行得通
No! How's that supposed to work?

273
00:10:22,114 --> 00:10:24,514
-背靠背 胳膊挽起來 -拜托
- Okay, back to back, um, and-and then link arms. - Come on.

274
00:10:24,514 --> 00:10:26,544
-好吧 -轉過來 胳膊伸過來
- Okay. - Turn around, give me your arm.

275
00:10:26,800 --> 00:10:28,160
瞧 就像這樣 明白嗎
See, look? Like this, all right?

276
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:29,320
我們看起來塊頭很大很可怕吧
Do we look big and scary?

277
00:10:29,620 --> 00:10:30,600
我想是的
Well, I think so.

278
00:10:30,620 --> 00:10:31,840
我們朝門移動
Let's move towards the door.

279
00:10:35,140 --> 00:10:35,740
好
Okay.

280
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:37,720
慢慢來
Nice and easy.

281
00:10:38,540 --> 00:10:43,520
我們是一個要去林間散步的大塊頭
We're just one big man out for a walk in the woods.

282
00:10:43,753 --> 00:10:44,634
分散
Scatter!

283
00:10:48,173 --> 00:10:48,924
活下來了
We made it.

284
00:10:49,763 --> 00:10:51,243
等等 米奇爾在哪
Wait! Where's Mitchell?

285
00:10:51,243 --> 00:10:52,183
他沒成功逃脫
He didn't make it!

286
00:10:52,183 --> 00:10:53,603
你們兩個人之一得去找他
One of you two need to go get him!

287
00:10:53,780 --> 00:10:55,620
我最好留在這做熊誘餌
I'm better staying here as a bear decoy.

288
00:10:55,633 --> 00:10:56,873
我身上自帶麝香味
I give off a natural musk.

289
00:10:56,873 --> 00:10:59,283
總有鳥落在我身上 松鼠也從我手里吃食
Birds land on me all the time. Squirrels eat out of my hand.

290
00:10:59,283 --> 00:11:01,923
我不能去 不能讓莉莉雙父雙亡
Well, I can't go! Lily needs at least one living parent!

291
00:11:03,413 --> 00:11:04,284
等等
Wait!

292
00:11:04,340 --> 00:11:05,940
我們怎么知道來的不是熊
How do we know it's not the bear?

293
00:11:05,940 --> 00:11:06,580
是我
It's me!

294
00:11:07,860 --> 00:11:09,440
你們把我拋下了
You just left me!

295
00:11:09,680 --> 00:11:11,000
你也沒在外面多久
Oh, you weren't out there that long.

296
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:12,060
你沒把吃的拿來嗎
You didn't get the food?!

297
00:11:12,140 --> 00:11:13,640
我差點成吃的了
I almost was food!

298
00:11:14,003 --> 00:11:16,273
我真希望壓根沒參加這破遠足
Okay, I-I wish I never even came on this stupid trip!

299
00:11:16,280 --> 00:11:17,440
誰逼你來的
Well, who forced you?

300
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:18,040
歌洛莉亞
Gloria!

301
00:11:23,140 --> 00:11:24,580
我是靠這腳脖子送披薩的
It's my delivery ankle.

302
00:11:24,580 --> 00:11:26,220
真的傷得很重 大伙
It's really bad, dudes.

303
00:11:26,532 --> 00:11:29,352
本來就有漆彈射擊的舊傷 卡爾
It was already weak from your paintball injury, Carl.

304
00:11:29,352 --> 00:11:30,622
我叫你去看醫生了
I told you to get it checked out,

305
00:11:30,760 --> 00:11:32,240
可你就是討厭醫生
but you and doctors.

306
00:11:33,482 --> 00:11:35,212
好吧 我跟他有點交情
Okay, fine, I know him a little.

307
00:11:35,392 --> 00:11:36,962
禍不單行 對吧
When it rains, it pours, huh?

308
00:11:37,420 --> 00:11:38,900
瑪格利特-安今早跟我分手了
Margaret-Anne left me this morning.

309
00:11:39,112 --> 00:11:41,262
然后我爸又在電話里叫我"克雷格"
Then my dad called me "Craig" On the phone again.

310
00:11:41,520 --> 00:11:42,780
那是他新兒子的名字
That's the name of his new son.

311
00:11:42,780 --> 00:11:44,960
天哪 卡爾 至少讓我們送你回家吧
Oh, God. Carl, can we at least drive you home?

312
00:11:45,340 --> 00:11:46,140
還不行
Not now.

313
00:11:46,302 --> 00:11:49,352
我得給勁敵西格瑪兄弟會送十張披薩
I have 10 pizzas going to my enemies, the Sigmas.

314
00:11:49,352 --> 00:11:51,432
那些富二代利用"30分鐘沒送到就免費"政策
Those rich kids get their kicks taking advantage

315
00:11:51,520 --> 00:11:52,980
占我們便宜 覺得很過癮
of our "30 Minutes or it's Free" Policy --

316
00:11:52,980 --> 00:11:54,580
用所有小把戲拖慢我的速度
use every trick in the book to slow me down.

317
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:56,960
今晚沒門 查德和奇普
Well, not tonight, Chad and Chip.

318
00:11:57,162 --> 00:11:58,353
今晚沒
Not to-

319
00:11:58,532 --> 00:12:00,082
骨頭肯定支出來了 對嗎
The bone's got to be sticking out, right?

320
00:12:00,082 --> 00:12:02,152
沒有 腫都沒腫
No, it's not even swollen.

321
00:12:02,622 --> 00:12:04,332
卡爾 我們今天都很不順
Look, Carl, we've all had rough days.

322
00:12:04,332 --> 00:12:06,342
何不讓我們幫你把披薩送到
Why don't you let us finish this delivery for you?

323
00:12:06,342 --> 00:12:08,212
好 可我們只剩十分鐘了
Okay, but we've only got, like, 10 minutes.

324
00:12:08,212 --> 00:12:09,671
那我們走 過來
Let's go, then! Come here.

325
00:12:09,671 --> 00:12:10,521
-好 -快來
- Okay. - Come on!

326
00:12:10,521 --> 00:12:12,981
今天完成一項任務會感覺很好的
It'll feel good to get something right today.

327
00:12:12,981 --> 00:12:13,911
再說 我不介意
Plus, I wouldn't mind

328
00:12:13,911 --> 00:12:15,751
收拾幾個兄弟會的白人小混蛋
sticking it to some preppy, white jerks.

329
00:12:15,751 --> 00:12:18,941
白人也有白人的煩惱
Hey! That life comes with its own problems!

330
00:12:23,660 --> 00:12:25,160
別生氣 爸
Don't be mad, Dad.

331
00:12:25,160 --> 00:12:26,620
歌洛莉亞也是擔心你嘛
Gloria was just worried about you.

332
00:12:26,620 --> 00:12:27,860
我不想談這事
I don't want to talk about it.

333
00:12:27,860 --> 00:12:29,640
我們就靜靜地喝一杯吧
Let's just have a drink and be quiet.

334
00:12:32,720 --> 00:12:34,640
那火焰呈現出很多種顏色 對吧
Lot of colors in that fire, huh?

335
00:12:36,260 --> 00:12:37,060
紅 綠
Red, green...

336
00:12:37,131 --> 00:12:38,611
-黃 藍... -老天 夠了
- yellow, blue... - Geez. Okay.

337
00:12:38,700 --> 00:12:41,280
你怎么老是逼逼個不停 干嘛呢
What is this yammering with you?! Seriously!

338
00:12:41,600 --> 00:12:42,780
我不知道
I don't know.

339
00:12:44,180 --> 00:12:46,700
可能我不喜歡與自己的思緒獨處吧
I guess I just don't like being alone with my own thoughts.

340
00:12:48,481 --> 00:12:50,581
又或者是因為我有兩個外孫快出生了
Maybe it's because I have a couple of grandkids on the way,

341
00:12:50,581 --> 00:12:52,480
但現在 如果周圍太安靜了
but now, if -- if things get too quiet,

342
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:54,870
我就會開始胡思亂想
my mind goes to a dark place fast.

343
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:57,000
開始擔心我愛的人
I start to worry about the people that I love

344
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:58,960
害怕他們會遭遇什么不測
and all the bad things that could happen to them.

345
00:12:59,640 --> 00:13:03,140
可能我內心覺得說話.... 會趕走那些念頭
I suppose talking... pushes those thoughts out

346
00:13:03,140 --> 00:13:04,440
讓我平靜下來
and helps me feel okay.

347
00:13:05,350 --> 00:13:06,290
我懂
I get it.

348
00:13:06,290 --> 00:13:07,651
我們都有充滿負能量的時候
We can all spiral.

349
00:13:08,020 --> 00:13:09,750
但你不能用說話來解決
But you can't talk your way out of it.

350
00:13:09,840 --> 00:13:11,380
而是得通過思考
You got to think your way out of it.

351
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:13,820
想象一個讓自己快樂的地方
You know, find a happy place.

352
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:15,520
試試這樣
Try this.

353
00:13:15,520 --> 00:13:17,660
30秒 不說話 開始
30 seconds, no talking. Go.

354
00:13:34,900 --> 00:13:36,729
-兄弟 你神游到哪去了 -我回來了
- Buddy, where are you? - I'm back. Yep.

355
00:13:36,739 --> 00:13:38,609
我認為我們能從他身上學到很多
You know, I think we can learn a lot from this guy,

356
00:13:38,609 --> 00:13:39,739
因為我們害怕的
because it's not the --

357
00:13:39,739 --> 00:13:42,669
不是外面的熊
the bears out there that we're afraid of.

358
00:13:42,669 --> 00:13:43,959
而是我們生活中的"熊"
It's the bears in our lives --

359
00:13:43,959 --> 00:13:46,259
讓我們夜不能寐
the fear that keeps us up at night.

360
00:13:46,259 --> 00:13:48,859
這個話題很有趣 等我換上"爐邊談心"裝后
And I think that's an interesting topic we can return to

361
00:13:48,859 --> 00:13:51,719
我們再繼續討論
once I change into my "Fireside Chat" Look.

362
00:13:51,719 --> 00:13:53,369
又去換衣服
Another wardrobe change?

363
00:13:53,399 --> 00:13:55,379
你就像婚禮當天的蘇丹新娘一樣 換裝個不停
You're like a sultan's bride on her wedding day.

364
00:13:55,379 --> 00:13:56,740
繼續說吧 取笑我吧
Go ahead -- make fun of me.

365
00:13:57,320 --> 00:13:58,420
我喜歡我的衣服
I like my outfits.

366
00:13:58,420 --> 00:13:59,500
為什么要那么多
Why so many?

367
00:13:59,500 --> 00:14:01,500
我想是因為我小的時候
Yeah, I guess when I was a kid,

368
00:14:01,500 --> 00:14:03,300
我發覺自己永遠都無法融入大眾
I realized I wasn't ever gonna fit in,

369
00:14:03,300 --> 00:14:04,900
于是我決定引人注目
so I decided to stand out.

370
00:14:04,900 --> 00:14:07,040
我坦然接受了自己的浮夸騷氣
I embraced my flamboyance

371
00:14:07,040 --> 00:14:09,300
好讓世人知道 他們的羞辱傷不了我
to let the world know their insults won't hurt me.

372
00:14:09,399 --> 00:14:12,129
想開我玩笑嗎 盡管開 因為我會配合你
Want to make a joke about me? Go ahead, 'cause I'm in on it.

373
00:14:13,340 --> 00:14:14,860
說得真好 小卡
That's really beautiful, Cam.

374
00:14:14,860 --> 00:14:16,940
而且你不是一個人
And you're not alone.

375
00:14:16,940 --> 00:14:20,020
誰小時候不是個沒安全感的書呆呢
Growing up, we were all insecure nerds in our own way.

376
00:14:22,420 --> 00:14:24,540
我小時候很酷
I was cool.

377
00:14:26,460 --> 00:14:28,400
怎么了 我們不是在分享內心故事嗎
What? I thought we were sharing.

378
00:14:28,918 --> 00:14:31,908
你很勇敢 小卡 了不起
That's very brave, Cam. That's good stuff.

379
00:14:35,738 --> 00:14:37,308
你瘋了嗎 不該由我來開車
Are you crazy?! I shouldn't be the one driving!

380
00:14:37,308 --> 00:14:39,638
沒時間爭論了 開就是了 快點
There is no time to argue! Just go! Come on!

381
00:14:41,580 --> 00:14:43,780
很感謝你們讓我加入你們
Thanks so much for making me part of your group.

382
00:14:43,780 --> 00:14:45,980
不是每天都能交到四個新死黨的
It's not every day you make four new best friends.

383
00:14:47,860 --> 00:14:49,480
他們為什么那么慢
Why are they going so slow?!

384
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:50,900
我沒法超過他們
I can't get past them!

385
00:14:50,900 --> 00:14:52,300
這是西格瑪兄弟會的策略之一
This is one of Sigma's tactics.

386
00:14:52,498 --> 00:14:53,648
他們用手機應用追蹤我所在地點
They track my location on the app

387
00:14:53,648 --> 00:14:55,388
然后派想入會的人來拖慢我的速度
and send pledges to try to slow me down.

388
00:14:55,388 --> 00:14:56,788
我該怎么辦
Ugh! What am I gonna do?!

389
00:14:56,788 --> 00:14:58,218
我來搞定
I'll handle this.

390
00:14:58,218 --> 00:15:00,278
卡爾 我要借用你的漆彈槍
Carl, I'm taking your paintball guns!

391
00:15:00,948 --> 00:15:02,788
讓開 否則我打爆你們
Move! Or I move you!

392
00:15:07,747 --> 00:15:09,557
我的哥倫比亞魂果然還在
I do still have my edge!

393
00:15:09,557 --> 00:15:10,578
好棒
Yes!

394
00:15:11,597 --> 00:15:13,007
你能加入我的漆彈隊伍嗎
Will you join my paintball team?

395
00:15:14,507 --> 00:15:15,374
那是什么玩意
What is that?!

396
00:15:15,374 --> 00:15:17,327
小黃人雷區 典型的西格瑪招數
Field of Minions. Classic Sigmas.

397
00:15:17,327 --> 00:15:18,457
別被他們的可愛分心
Don't get distracted by the cuteness.

398
00:15:18,580 --> 00:15:19,680
我們只剩下五分鐘
We only have five minutes.

399
00:15:19,680 --> 00:15:21,000
直接繞過它們
Just go around them.

400
00:15:26,387 --> 00:15:27,588
天啊 我做到了
Oh, my God, I did it!

401
00:15:27,707 --> 00:15:29,057
你們都還在車上 沒人被甩出去
And you're all still in the car!

402
00:15:29,057 --> 00:15:30,727
好了 我們不能讓他們找到借口
Okay, now, we can't give them any reason to say

403
00:15:31,867 --> 00:15:33,447
趕快檢查披薩 確保配料沒移位
so check the pizzas, make sure they didn't shift.

404
00:15:33,447 --> 00:15:36,147
海莉 我覺得你多慮了
Oh, Haley, I'm sure you're worrying about nothing --

405
00:15:41,687 --> 00:15:43,317
卡爾 你有披薩切片器嗎
Carl, do you have a pizza slicer?

406
00:15:43,617 --> 00:15:45,787
只有一個我為公司服務十年得到的紀念切片器
Only the commemorative one I got for 10 years of service.

407
00:15:45,787 --> 00:15:47,348
給我 我腦中有畫面了
Give it to me. I have a vision.

408
00:15:47,997 --> 00:15:50,406
奧尼爾和亨德里克斯從沒能突破自身弱點
Shaq and Hendrix never got past their blind spots.

409
00:15:50,406 --> 00:15:52,196
也許是因為他們不夠渴望
Maybe they didn't want it enough.

410
00:15:52,196 --> 00:15:54,726
想把九個披薩變成十個 很簡單
Turning 9 pizzas into 10 was a simple matter

411
00:15:54,780 --> 00:15:56,700
只需從每個披薩切走一片
of removing one slice from each pie,

412
00:15:56,700 --> 00:15:58,540
然后將剩下的披薩
then trimming off a V-shaped portion of pizza

413
00:15:58,540 --> 00:15:59,820
每片都切走一小塊V型
from each of the remaining slices,

414
00:15:59,936 --> 00:16:02,216
把切片從36°角變為40°角
turning them from 36-degree angles to 40-degree angles,

415
00:16:02,216 --> 00:16:03,516
再把所有40°角的切片
then putting together the 40-degree angles

416
00:16:03,516 --> 00:16:05,346
拼成九個小了一圈的披薩
into nine slightly smaller pies.

417
00:16:05,346 --> 00:16:07,666
之后 再用一開始切出的九片披薩
After that, one had only to repurpose

418
00:16:07,666 --> 00:16:10,936
拼出第十個披薩
the nine previously removed slices into a 10th pie.

419
00:16:12,266 --> 00:16:14,066
十個
And...10!

420
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:14,900
成功了
It worked!

421
00:16:14,920 --> 00:16:15,840
真的成功了
It really did.

422
00:16:16,120 --> 00:16:17,300
我果然有圖像式腦子
I do have a visual brain.

423
00:16:17,356 --> 00:16:18,306
這就是你糾結的事嗎
That was your thing?

424
00:16:18,306 --> 00:16:21,006
我真不懷念有白人煩惱
I do not miss having white-people problems.

425
00:16:21,916 --> 00:16:23,456
到了 我成功了
We're here! I did it!

426
00:16:23,456 --> 00:16:25,726
得在一分鐘之內把披薩送進屋 走吧
We only have a minute to get the pizzas inside. Let's go!

427
00:16:25,976 --> 00:16:28,216
等一下 等一下 兄弟會有可視門鈴
Oh, wait, wait, wait! Uh, the frat has a video doorbell.

428
00:16:28,216 --> 00:16:30,316
他們如果看到是外賣 就會拖延到超時
If they see it's a delivery, they try to run out the clock.

429
00:16:30,436 --> 00:16:31,647
我來搞定
I'll handle this.

430
00:16:33,765 --> 00:16:35,086
靠那邊站
Stay on that side.

431
00:16:37,085 --> 00:16:37,956
什么事
Yeah?

432
00:16:37,995 --> 00:16:39,385
你好
Hi. Um...

433
00:16:39,765 --> 00:16:42,735
我是A大的 人家醉得不行了
I go to U of A, and I'm super drunk.

434
00:16:42,880 --> 00:16:45,400
你們有地方借我醒酒過夜嗎
Is there a place where I can sober up for the night?

435
00:16:47,820 --> 00:16:50,200
至少老娘的臉還足夠美艷 能進入兄弟會的房子
At least my looks can still get me into a frat house.

436
00:16:50,675 --> 00:16:51,756
好了 各位 上啊
Okay, guys, go, go!

437
00:16:52,565 --> 00:16:54,825
十個披薩準時送達
10 pizzas on time.

438
00:16:54,975 --> 00:16:55,966
付錢
Pay up!

439
00:16:55,995 --> 00:16:57,115
你們跟卡爾是一伙的嗎
You guys with Carl?

440
00:16:57,115 --> 00:16:59,045
我們就是卡爾
We are Carl.

441
00:17:01,835 --> 00:17:03,485
來吧 快點 愿賭服輸
Come on, hurry up! A bet's a bet!

442
00:17:03,485 --> 00:17:06,155
我就說我能比你們金雞獨立更久
I told you I could stand on one leg longer than you!

443
00:17:06,155 --> 00:17:07,995
你是唯一一個喝完一大杯威士忌后
You're the only one whose balance gets better

444
00:17:08,040 --> 00:17:09,620
平衡感反而比喝之前更好的人
after drinking a jug of whiskey.

445
00:17:09,620 --> 00:17:12,260
好啦 我的粉絲一定會喜歡這畫面
All right. My follower is gonna love this!

446
00:17:12,260 --> 00:17:13,300
大家說"茄子"
Everybody say "Cheese!"

447
00:17:13,655 --> 00:17:14,625
-茄子 -很好
- Cheese. - Yes.

448
00:17:14,625 --> 00:17:16,264
好啦 這就是建立起自我品牌的方法
Okay, now, that is how you build a brand.

449
00:17:16,300 --> 00:17:18,220
看來我們應該繼續把剩下的威士忌喝完
Well, I guess we should kill the rest of this whiskey.

450
00:17:18,220 --> 00:17:21,040
那殺人魔來的時候我們請人家喝什么啊
But then we'll have nothing to serve the murderers when they arrive.

451
00:17:21,040 --> 00:17:22,840
雖然你漫不經心開玩笑
You know, you joke,

452
00:17:22,884 --> 00:17:25,324
但你語氣里暗藏著某種偏執妄想
but you have a certain paranoia about you.

453
00:17:25,324 --> 00:17:26,804
這... 背后到底是什么原因呢
What -- What's behind that?

454
00:17:26,804 --> 00:17:27,624
這個嘛...
Well...

455
00:17:27,624 --> 00:17:30,054
我們要聽到米奇爾心中的"熊"了嗎
Ooh! Are we about to hear about Mitchell's bear?

456
00:17:30,054 --> 00:17:31,435
好吧 其實是...
Uh, okay. It -- It's, um...

457
00:17:31,904 --> 00:17:33,914
我沒有跟任何人說過 但是...
I've never told anyone this, but, uh,

458
00:17:33,914 --> 00:17:36,174
有個算命師曾經預言
a fortune teller once predicted

459
00:17:36,174 --> 00:17:39,044
我活不到46歲的冬天
that I would not live to see my 46th winter.

460
00:17:39,044 --> 00:17:41,634
是以前我們家隔壁的那個瘋子嗎
Was that that kook that used to live next door to us?

461
00:17:41,700 --> 00:17:42,420
她是神經病啊
She's nuts.

462
00:17:42,834 --> 00:17:45,264
她還說過你媽有一天會贏托尼獎呢
She told your mother she was gonna win a Tony one day.

463
00:17:45,264 --> 00:17:47,494
但她也預言對了其他很多事情啊
But she was right about a lot of other things.

464
00:17:47,494 --> 00:17:49,344
她說我會變成律師
She said that I'd become a lawyer.

465
00:17:49,514 --> 00:17:52,254
她還說我有一天會跟一個小丑結婚
She said that I would marry a clown one day.

466
00:17:52,400 --> 00:17:54,360
當時聽到我可是笑了好久
Laughed a long time about that one.

467
00:17:54,420 --> 00:17:54,860
為什么要笑
Why?

468
00:17:54,954 --> 00:17:57,214
總而言之 我內心的"熊"
Anyway, I-I guess my "Bear"

469
00:17:57,214 --> 00:17:59,044
大概就是害怕英年早逝吧
is the fear of dying young.

470
00:17:59,144 --> 00:18:00,813
如果那個算命師算得準
Uh, I mean, if that fortune teller's right,

471
00:18:00,940 --> 00:18:02,600
那我只剩三年能活了
I only have three more years to live.

472
00:18:03,383 --> 00:18:04,753
你知道嗎 按我來看
Well, y-you know what? The way I see it,

473
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:06,860
這個小小的詛咒是上天的禮物
this little curse is actually a gift --

474
00:18:06,860 --> 00:18:09,480
讓你有理由充分享受人生
a reason to live life to the fullest.

475
00:18:09,480 --> 00:18:10,880
也不給自己留下遺憾
And have no regrets.

476
00:18:11,043 --> 00:18:14,693
行 大家都相信并接受我活不過46歲了
Okay, so we're all just accepting this 46-year thing as true?

477
00:18:14,693 --> 00:18:16,413
我們能理性看待它
We've made our peace with it.

478
00:18:16,533 --> 00:18:17,573
你也應該這樣
And so should you.

479
00:18:17,573 --> 00:18:20,373
為什么不在你有限的日子里
Why not just live your limited days

480
00:18:20,480 --> 00:18:21,720
做到心中不藏著任何話
with leaving nothing unsaid?

481
00:18:22,283 --> 00:18:24,663
對你最在乎的人說出你的感受
Tell the people who matter the most how you feel.

482
00:18:24,663 --> 00:18:27,563
我每天都跟你與莉莉說我愛你
I tell you and Lily I love you every single day.

483
00:18:27,563 --> 00:18:29,143
的確 那對菲爾呢
True. What about Phil?

484
00:18:29,143 --> 00:18:32,183
他今天早上也有發短信給我說"愛尼"
He did text me with a "Love ya" this morning.

485
00:18:32,183 --> 00:18:32,963
也能算數
Close enough.

486
00:18:33,040 --> 00:18:34,440
那你爸爸呢
And your dad?

487
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:39,880
你不是吧
Seriously?!

488
00:18:40,003 --> 00:18:41,753
對他開口說這個詞很難嘛
I just have a hard time saying that word to him.

489
00:18:41,753 --> 00:18:43,473
我個人對此也沒有意見
Which is fine for the both of us.

490
00:18:43,513 --> 00:18:44,562
好吧 感覺起來
Okay, well, it sounds like

491
00:18:44,562 --> 00:18:46,842
你也羞于說出這個詞
you might be uncomfortable with that word, too.

492
00:18:46,842 --> 00:18:48,882
才沒有 我對這詞沒任何問題 我整天說
No! I don't have a problem with it. I use it all the time.

493
00:18:48,882 --> 00:18:50,752
我整天都有在說我愛什么東西
I'm always saying I love things. I --

494
00:18:50,782 --> 00:18:53,102
我愛穿上用微波爐熱過的溫暖襪子
I love the feel of toasty socks out of the microwave.

495
00:18:53,102 --> 00:18:55,982
我愛聽遠方火車汽笛的聲音
I love the far-off sound of a train whistle.

496
00:18:55,982 --> 00:18:58,962
會感覺"他們又去哪里冒險啦"
You know, "Ooh! What adventure have they gotten off to?"

497
00:18:58,962 --> 00:19:01,262
我還愛看嬰兒伸懶腰
I -- I love watching a baby stretch.

498
00:19:01,262 --> 00:19:03,612
杰 這些都是你生活中的美好事物 但...
Those are all good things in your life, Jay, but...

499
00:19:04,460 --> 00:19:05,340
你的"熊"是什么
what's your "bear"?

500
00:19:05,632 --> 00:19:06,542
我沒有啊
I don't have one.

501
00:19:06,542 --> 00:19:08,362
別這樣 我們都說出自己的了
Oh, come on! We all told you ours.

502
00:19:08,362 --> 00:19:10,102
等你們活到我這個歲數
Now, when you get to my age,

503
00:19:10,260 --> 00:19:13,300
人生中能讓你害怕的事物就越來越少了
there are less things that you're afraid of.

504
00:19:13,300 --> 00:19:14,420
除了或許...
Except maybe...

505
00:19:14,920 --> 00:19:17,120
自己變成家人的累贅
being a burden to your family.

506
00:19:17,120 --> 00:19:18,560
而這已經開始發生
Which is starting already,

507
00:19:18,560 --> 00:19:21,080
因為歌洛莉亞逼你們來照顧我
because Gloria forced you guys to babysit me,

508
00:19:21,080 --> 00:19:24,440
這也是為何我執意要在此過夜
which is why I wanted to spend the night here

509
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:29,060
好證明自己不是... 脆弱的糟老頭
so I could prove I'm not some...frail old man.

510
00:19:29,421 --> 00:19:30,931
但如果要我實話實說
But, if I'm being honest,

511
00:19:30,980 --> 00:19:32,960
每年爬上來都感覺比前一年更累了
that hike gets tougher for me every year.

512
00:19:34,220 --> 00:19:37,580
我今年也慶幸我不是自己一個人爬
And I was relieved that I didn't have to do it alone.

513
00:19:37,700 --> 00:19:38,420
老爸
Oh, Dad.

514
00:19:38,840 --> 00:19:40,460
你永遠不會是累贅
You could never be a burden.

515
00:19:40,580 --> 00:19:43,180
對啊 你才是總是照顧著我們大家的人
Yeah, you're the one who's always taking care of all of us.

516
00:19:43,180 --> 00:19:45,060
我們很樂意有機會照顧你
We'd love the chance to return the favor.

517
00:19:47,601 --> 00:19:49,211
好啦 時間晚了
All right. It's getting late.

518
00:19:49,211 --> 00:19:51,581
這個山地皮條客裝穿到我流汗
This mountain pimp outfit's making me sweat.

519
00:19:51,660 --> 00:19:52,900
大家... 大家都去睡了吧
Let's -- Let's get some rest.

520
00:19:53,780 --> 00:19:54,540
晚安
Good night.

521
00:19:54,560 --> 00:19:56,460
晚安啦 我睡沙發
Good night. I'll take the sofa.

522
00:19:56,801 --> 00:19:58,081
你確定你自己睡這里沒問題嗎
Sure you're gonna be okay out here?

523
00:19:58,081 --> 00:19:59,711
-當然啦 我肯定沒事 -好
- Yeah, I'll be fine. - Okay.

524
00:20:01,921 --> 00:20:03,431
你... 你要不要我幫你多拿條被子還什么
Do -- Do you want me to grab you an extra blanket or something?

525
00:20:03,640 --> 00:20:06,440
不 不用了 我需要會自己去拿
No, no. I'll get something if I need it.

526
00:20:06,531 --> 00:20:08,012
好吧 那...
Okay. Well...

527
00:20:09,600 --> 00:20:10,480
晚安啦
Good night.

528
00:20:15,700 --> 00:20:16,340
我都知道
I know.

529
00:20:33,940 --> 00:20:35,920
好啦 老爸 我們準備好走了
All right, Dad. We're ready to go.

530
00:20:35,920 --> 00:20:36,600
對啊 杰
Yeah, Jay.

531
00:20:36,660 --> 00:20:38,800
很遺憾你這次又沒有看到白頭鷹
I'm sorry you didn't see a bald eagle this time around.

532
00:20:39,010 --> 00:20:40,690
是啊 太遺憾了
Y-Yeah. It's too bad.

533
00:20:40,730 --> 00:20:43,100
看來我們只能明年再一起回來碰運氣了
I guess we'll all have to come back here again next year.

534
00:20:43,100 --> 00:20:44,011
好啊
Yeah.

535
00:20:44,320 --> 00:20:46,440
我不知道你們怎么樣 但我睡得好香
I don't know about you guys, but I slept great.

536
00:20:46,450 --> 00:20:49,350
那個小床好軟 我平常很容易睡不好
That cot was so soft. I'm not always a sound sleeper.

537
00:20:49,350 --> 00:20:50,870
本來還一直很想去試試吃褪黑素
Been meaning to try that melatonin.

538
00:20:51,100 --> 00:20:52,080
我聽說超級有效呢
I hear it's a real game-changer.

539
00:20:52,350 --> 00:20:53,930
現在那東西好像到處都有賣
And you can get it anywhere nowadays.

540
00:20:54,200 --> 00:20:55,420
那東西一直都是非處方藥[柜臺外]嗎
Has it always been over-the-counter?

541
00:20:55,420 --> 00:20:57,380
這詞挺有意思的對吧 "柜臺外面"
Kind of a funny phrase, isn't it -- "Over-the-counter"?
